  "objectives": [
    "Explain the core principle of Valence Shell Electron Pair Repulsion (VSEPR) theory.",
    "Identify the five fundamental electron-domain geometries.",
    "Predict the three-dimensional molecular geometry based on the number of bonding and non-bonding electron pairs around a central atom.",
    "Explain how the presence of lone pairs influences bond angles compared to idealized geometries."
